### Add one
POST http://localhost:8080/api/watchlist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "tcs",
  "companyName": "Tata Consultancy Services",
  "targetPrice": 3800.00,
  "notes": "watching for a dip"
}

### List all
GET http://localhost:8080/api/watchlist

### Get one
GET http://localhost:8080/api/watchlist/1

### Search
GET http://localhost:8080/api/watchlist/search?symbol=TCS

### Delete
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/watchlist/2

### Invalid
POST http://localhost:8080/api/watchlist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "",
  "targetPrice": -50
}